      "date": "2026-06-10T12:50:00.000Z",
      "title": "Esaar (India) Ltd Appoints Dipesh B. Mistri as Chief Financial Officer, Effective June 10, 2026",
      "body": "Esaar (India) Ltd. at its board meeting held on June 10, 2026 and approved the appointment of Mr. Dipesh B. Mistri as Chief Financial Officer and Key Managerial Personnel of the Company with effect from June 10, 2026. Mr. Dipesh B. Mistri has around 10+ years of professional experience in the field of finance, accounts, taxation, corporate law, and regulatory compliances, with strong knowledge of financial management and reporting. He has extensive experience in financial planning and analysis, budgeting, forecasting, fund management, statutory audits, internal financial controls, and preparation of financial statements in accordance with applicable accounting standards, contributing effectively to sound financial governance and decision-making.",
