      "date": "2026-06-02T11:27:36.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.45 (vs ₹1.10 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.45 (up from ₹1.10 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹417.9m (up 121% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹111.4m (up ₹133.8m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 27% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 54% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 23% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
